# Normalize line endings across platforms.
# Text files are stored with LF in the repo and checked out with LF,
# so their bytes are identical on Windows, Linux and macOS.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Files whose exact bytes are hashed or signed — force LF explicitly.
*.json   text eol=lf
*.md     text eol=lf
*.pem    text eol=lf
*.sha256 text eol=lf

# Opaque binary artifacts — never touch their bytes.
*.sig -text
*.tsq -text
*.tsr -text
*.der -text